pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 案例四关键实现｜来源校验、路径白名单与凭证隔离
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 将安全要求落实到请求入口，而不是依赖插件页面自行遵守约定。
  - elementId: code-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 148, 560, 282]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: code
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 162, 528, 254]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Consolas"
      fontSize: 11.2
      color: "$white"
      lineHeight: 1.2
      text: |
        const prefix = `/v0/management/${pluginId}`;
        if (!iframeOrigin || event.origin !== iframeOrigin) return;
        if (!isPluginAPIRequestAllowed(method, path, pluginId)) {
          respond({ ok: false, status: 400 });
          return;
        }

        // plugin page never receives Management Key
        // analytics detail exposes masked values only
  - elementId: r-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 148, 240, 30]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: SECURITY RULES
  - elementId: r
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 188, 240, 214]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p><strong>来源校验</strong>：iframe 声明来源与 message event.origin 双重匹配。</p>
        <p><strong>路径限制</strong>：普通插件仅能访问自身命名空间下的管理路径。</p>
        <p><strong>凭证隔离</strong>：API Client 由宿主持有，页面不接触 Management Key。</p>
        <p><strong>数据脱敏</strong>：Analytics 明细不暴露 raw_json 与明文 Key。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 464, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 代码位置：src/features/plugins/pluginResources.ts、PluginResourcePage.tsx、useMonitoringData.ts。
